if anything needs doing.</p></div></div><p class="cta"><a class="btn" href="{{ PathBase }}/library/before-your-first-visit">What to bring</a><a class="btn line" href="{{ PathBase }}/library/if-you-are-nervous-about-the-dentist">If you are nervous</a></p></div><div><div class="card"><p class="kick">Hours</p><table class="hours"><tr class="{% if wdn == 1 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Monday{% if wdn == 1 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–18:00</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 2 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Tuesday{% if wdn == 2 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–18:00</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 3 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Wednesday{% if wdn == 3 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–18:00</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 4 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Thursday{% if wdn == 4 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–18:00</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 5 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Friday{% if wdn == 5 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–15:00</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 6 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Saturday{% if wdn == 6 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>8:00–12:00 (hygiene)</td></tr><tr class="{% if wdn == 0 %}today{% endif %}"><td>Sunday{% if wdn == 0 %} · today{% endif %}</td><td>Closed</td></tr></table><p style="margin:16px 0 0"><b>22 Ferry Street, Tansey Ford</b><br>Step-free entrance on Mill Lane. Four parking spaces behind the building; the town lot is two minutes away.<br><span class="mono">555-0181</span> · hello@merriwold.example</p></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><p class="kick">Insurance</p><p style="margin:0">We work with most dental insurers and check every estimate with yours before treatment. No insurance? Ask at the desk; there is nothing to sign up for on this website.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
